1
00:00:00,097 --> 00:00:02,977
(Leonard:)Sheldon, there are a million
great vacations you could take.

2
00:00:03,184 --> 00:00:04,354
(Leonard:)What about Hawaii?

3
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:09,190
Hawaii is a former Ieper colony
on top of an active volcano...

4
00:00:09,398 --> 00:00:12,688
(Sheldon:)...where the disappointing ending
to Lost was filmed.

5
00:00:15,237 --> 00:00:17,867
(Sheldon:)Mahalo for nothing, Hawaii.

6
00:00:18,074 --> 00:00:19,364
(Howard:)How about Florida?

7
00:00:19,575 --> 00:00:21,535
They got Cape Canaveral,
they got Disney.

8
00:00:21,744 --> 00:00:25,244
They got my Aunt lda and the world's
Iargest collection of diabetic candy.

9
00:00:25,456 --> 00:00:27,206
And plus, if you get sweaty enough...

10
00:00:27,416 --> 00:00:30,006
(Howard:)...her plastic-covered furniture
is Iike a flume ride.

11
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:34,010
(Sheldon:)My family took a trip to Florida
when I was a child.

12
00:00:34,215 --> 00:00:38,175
(Sheldon:)A seagull stole a hot dog from me
on the beach.

13
00:00:38,386 --> 00:00:39,556
(Sheldon:)I got the message.

14
00:00:40,971 --> 00:00:42,221
(Raj:)If I had a week off...

15
00:00:42,431 --> 00:00:45,601
(Raj:)...I'd go back to the Two Bunch Palms
Resort and Spa in the desert.

16
00:00:45,810 --> 00:00:48,400
(Raj:)I tell you, an hour on the massage table
with Trevor...

17
00:00:48,604 --> 00:00:51,814
(Raj:)...and you'll feel like you were born
without bones.

18
00:00:52,942 --> 00:00:56,022
(Howard:)I don't think I could ever let a guy
give me a massage.

